    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, the <strong>Victors' Test</strong> was an examination designed to measure a person's resistance and aptitude for dealing with anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participants were tasked with guarding a <strong>museum</strong> for five nights\u2014an institution that housed anomalous artifacts or even the anomalies themselves. The museum itself was a part of the anomaly, and those who passed this test were deemed suitable for working with such phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now, the <strong>museum</strong> and its <strong>artifacts</strong> no longer exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This system, <strong>Reves</strong>, is a recreation of the <strong>Victors' Test</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to <strong>observe and report</strong> the state of the exhibited artifacts. Determine whether they remain <strong>normal</strong> or if they have undergone <strong>dangerous anomalies</strong>, and choose between the <strong>Red Door</strong> and the <strong>Blue Door</strong> to proceed to the next room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is not merely a <strong>game of finding anomalies</strong>.<br>The doors ahead will change <strong>based on the presence or absence of anomalies</strong>.<br>At times, you will need to <strong>induce</strong> or <strong>erase</strong> anomalies <strong>intentionally</strong> to carve a path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal is to inspect <strong>all designated artifacts</strong> and return safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>battle of wits</strong> between you and the <strong>ever-changing museum of anomalies</strong>.<br>It is no longer a mere &quot;spot-the-difference&quot; challenge.<br>No\u2014this has <strong>evolved into something far beyond that</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Victors' Test: Night Reves.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player explores the <strong>Infinite Museum</strong>, checking the state of its ever-changing <strong>artifacts</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room presents a <strong>choice between the Red Door and the Blue Door</strong>, with the <strong>next room's state depending on whether anomalies exist</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By <strong>identifying, triggering, or erasing anomalies</strong>, players manipulate their path forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate goal is to <strong>inspect all designated artifacts and return safely</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
