ew</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player explores the <strong>Infinite Museum</strong>, checking the state of its ever-changing <strong>artifacts</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room presents a <strong>choice between the Red Door and the Blue Door</strong>, with the <strong>next room's state depending on whether anomalies exist</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By <strong>identifying, triggering, or erasing anomalies</strong>, players manipulate their path forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate goal is to <strong>inspect all designated artifacts and return safely</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
